[ftw33616@uxa.cso.uiuc.edu (Frank T. Wang) writes:]
[] Is there a minimum level to have a bones file appear?  I've never had a
[] bones file above 16 & was wondering if say, you have to be below level 10
[] to have a bones file, or if it is truly random.

for 3.0 keep in mind the number 3:
1) no bones on levels 1, 2 or 3.
2) probability of leaving bones is 1 in 3 otherwise (with exceptions
    for special levels and you won't overwrite bones already on disk).
3) probability of getting bones is 1 in 3 (with exceptions).

in all this, it is possible to acquire old bones and then generate
new bones thus adding to the history of those bones if you die on
the same level (etc...).

